1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:03,036
Some dreams begin in winter light...

2
00:00:05,300 --> 00:00:08,012
And Finland makes them come alive.

3
00:00:10,300 --> 00:00:13,228
Every snowflake holds a little magic.

4
00:00:15,300 --> 00:00:17,724
Every step leads into wonder.

5
00:00:20,300 --> 00:00:23,420
Where snowflakes dance, dreams awaken.

6
00:00:25,467 --> 00:00:28,131
Even the coldest nights hold warmth.

7
00:00:30,467 --> 00:00:33,731
Beneath the glass, the stars feel closer.

8
00:00:35,467 --> 00:00:38,635
When the world grows quiet, stars awaken.

9
00:00:40,467 --> 00:00:43,563
And suddenly, the sky begins to glow.

10
00:00:45,467 --> 00:00:49,163
Tonight, let every dream dance with the Northern Lights!

11
00:00:50,717 --> 00:00:54,029
Finland, you are a winter sky full of wonder.

12
00:00:56,008 --> 00:00:59,128
And the most beautiful dreams shine forever.
